# Stray file from a 2026-06-30 PowerShell icon-generation mishap. The
# file is owned by a different user than the workspace owner (likely
# SYSTEM) and refuses to be deleted from this session even with
# `takeown /F`. It is a 193-byte corrupted PNG, not referenced by any
# build, and does not affect any artifact. Safe to delete with admin
# tools (handle.exe + close handle, or system restart).
